# L §2.3 (writer 8): paths() is gone; L §2.2 lists no built-in paths, and a call takes a built-in's name or a band's
# id (L §2.3 Calls), so `paths()` names no band: LOAD-NAME. (Was: "paths() reads N", removed by the review.)
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
